==============================================================================
PART 3 - repeated init/deinit with the LEDC teardown in place
flow: CONFIG_PRD_DISPLAY_CLOCK_SWEEP

display::deinit() now also releases the LEDC channel and timer, so the Phase C
repeated-initialisation path was re-run to confirm the backlight comes back up
cleanly every time. Each clock step is a full init/deinit cycle.
Also confirms startup_percent=50 is the effective default after selection.
